OL,5,G0440 Great Coastal Railway Journeys
OL,6,     FWhitby to Robin Hood's Bay:
OL,7,     FMichael Portillo travels from
OL,8,     FWhitby, where he explores the
OL,9,     Fport's shipbuilding and seafaring
OL,10,     Fheritage, to Robin Hood's Bay, a
OL,11,     Fformer smuggling haven.
OL,12,G0505 Great Coastal Railway Journeys
OL,13,     FScarborough to Bridlington:
OL,14,     FMichael Portillo is in the North
OL,15,     FYorkshire seaside resort of
OL,16,     FScarborough to explore one of the
OL,17,     Fgreatest royal fortresses in
OL,18,     FEngland.
